-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_f63013570e.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_f63013570e","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Tara Park Al Reem Island Abu Dhabi by Modon Holding - Modern Island Living ","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location on Al Reem Island – Positioned in one of Abu Dhabi’s fastest-growing districts with excellent connectivity to business, lifestyle, and cultural landmarks.</li><li>Modern Residential Towers – Two thoughtfully designed towers offering contemporary apartments with efficient layouts and natural light.</li><li>Contemporary Apartment Selection – A collection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom residences designed to maximize space, functionality, and modern living comfort.</li><li>Comprehensive Lifestyle Amenities – Residents benefit from wellness, recreation, and social facilities designed for an active and balanced lifestyle.</li><li>Developed By Modon Holding – A reputable developer delivering well-planned communities focused on long-term value and quality urban living.</li><li>50/50 Payment Structure – A balanced payment schedule provides convenient purchasing opportunities for both investors and end-users.</li><li>5% Down Payment – Buyers can secure a residence with a low initial commitment, making entry into the development highly accessible.</li><li>Strong Capital Appreciation Potential – Located in a rapidly developing area, the project offers promising long-term growth and investment appeal.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2125,"cta":{"id":2963,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_2ce570350a.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_2ce570350a","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"